cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "granary: A very large item-level open dataset of psychological traits and attitudes"
message: >-
  If you use this compiled dataset, please cite it as below, and also cite the
  original sources for the data you use (listed per source in the README).
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Hussey
    given-names: Ian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8906-7559"
abstract: >-
  Granary is a large store of granular, item-level psychological measurement
  data, both self-report trait scales and attitude ratings, pooled from several
  public datasets into one harmonised, cleaned, and analysis-ready collection.
  It exists to study the distributional properties of psychological measures
  across a wide range of scales, samples, response formats, and construct types.
keywords:
  - psychology
  - psychometrics
  - individual differences
  - item-level data
  - self-report
  - attitudes
  - open data
